{"module":"practice","item":{"id":"a2-practice-36","level":"A2","kind":"mcq","title":{"de":"stellen/stehen, legen/liegen","bn":"রাখা ও থাকা"},"questions":[{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Der Brief ___ auf dem Sofa. (শোয়ানো আছে)","options":["legt","steht","liegt"],"answer":2,"explanation":"থাকা (Wo?): liegen।","id":"a2-practice-36-q1"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich ___ die Tasse auf den Tisch. (খাড়া করে রাখি)","options":["stelle","stehe","lege"],"answer":0,"explanation":"রাখা (Wohin?): stellen।","id":"a2-practice-36-q2"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Die Tasse steht auf ___ Tisch.","options":["das","dem","den"],"answer":1,"explanation":"stehen → Wo? → Dativ।","id":"a2-practice-36-q3"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich lege den Brief auf ___ Bett.","options":["dem","der","das"],"answer":2,"explanation":"legen → Wohin? → Akkusativ।","id":"a2-practice-36-q4"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Oma ___ im Garten. (বসে আছেন)","options":["sitzt","setzt","stellt"],"answer":0,"id":"a2-practice-36-q5"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Die Hose hängt ___ Schrank.","options":["ins","im","in den"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Wo? → in + dem = im।","id":"a2-practice-36-q6"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"কোনটি „থাকা“ বোঝায় (Wo?)?","options":["stellen","legen","stehen"],"answer":2,"id":"a2-practice-36-q7"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"stellen, legen, setzen-এর পরে কোন case?","options":["Akkusativ","Dativ","Nominativ"],"answer":0,"id":"a2-practice-36-q8"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Die Mutter ___ das Kind auf den Stuhl. (বসান)","options":["liegt","setzt","sitzt"],"answer":1,"id":"a2-practice-36-q9"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich ___ die Jacke in den Schrank. (ঝুলিয়ে রাখি)","options":["hängt","lege","hänge"],"answer":2,"id":"a2-practice-36-q10"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„Das Handy liegt auf dem Sofa.“ মানে কী?","options":["ফোনটি সোফার ওপর আছে।","আমি ফোনটি সোফার ওপর রাখি।","ফোনটি সোফার নিচে আছে।"],"answer":0,"id":"a2-practice-36-q11"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Wir treffen uns vor ___ Kino.","options":["den","dem","das"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Wo? → Dativ।","id":"a2-practice-36-q12"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„einen Termin vereinbaren“ মানে কী?","options":["একটি অ্যাপয়েন্টমেন্ট পেছানো","একটি পরামর্শ দেওয়া","একটি অ্যাপয়েন্টমেন্ট নির্ধারণ করা"],"answer":2,"id":"a2-practice-36-q13"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„Ich bin krankgeschrieben.“ মানে কী?","options":["আমি অসুস্থতার কারণে ছুটিতে আছি।","আমি সুস্থ।","আমার একটি দুর্ঘটনা হয়েছে।"],"answer":0,"id":"a2-practice-36-q14"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Das Rezept ist ___ dich.","options":["gegen","für","um"],"answer":1,"id":"a2-practice-36-q15"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Früher ___ ich oft krank. (ছিলাম)","options":["hatte","bin","war"],"answer":2,"id":"a2-practice-36-q16"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„erkältet“ মানে কী?","options":["ঠান্ডা লেগেছে","আহত","সফল"],"answer":0,"id":"a2-practice-36-q17"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„Ich habe Hunger.“ মানে কী?","options":["আমি ক্লান্ত।","আমার ক্ষুধা লেগেছে।","আমার তৃষ্ণা পেয়েছে।"],"answer":1,"explanation":"A1 মনে করুন।","id":"a2-practice-36-q18"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Sara: „Ich habe die Tabletten auf den Tisch gelegt. Die Flasche Wasser steht neben den Tabletten. Bitte nehmen Sie eine Tablette!“\nট্যাবলেটগুলো কোথায়?","options":["আলমারিতে","সোফার নিচে","টেবিলের ওপরে"],"answer":2,"id":"a2-practice-36-q19"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„Das Kind sitzt nicht auf dem Stuhl, sondern auf dem Sofa. Seine Jacke hängt an der Tür.“\nশিশুটি কোথায় বসে আছে?","options":["সোফায়","চেয়ারে","দরজার পাশে"],"answer":0,"id":"a2-practice-36-q20"}],"requires":{"grammar":13,"vocabulary":20}},"schema":1,"id":"a2-practice-36","level":"A2","test":[]}